  "code": "const mask = maskGray / 255;\nconst pDark = 1 - gray / 255;\nconst strength = Math.min(magnitude / 180, 1);\nconst pFeature = alpha * pDark + (1 - alpha) * strength;\nconst probability = mask * pFeature;\nif (random() < probability) {\n  drawStroke(x, y, 16, angle);\n}",
  "codeNote": "先に暗さと輪郭の基本確率を作り、次にマスクを掛けます。mask=0は描画禁止、mask=1はそのまま、mask≈0.5は確率を半分ほどにします。",
