  "demo": {
    "title": "マスクで筆跡の範囲を決める",
    "caption": "初期値は海辺、マスク全体が灰色128（許可率約50%）、暗さの重み65%、候補1200個、勾配基準180、線長16px、線幅3px、シード42です。白く塗って通し、黒く塗って止め、灰色で弱めます。",
    "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"ja\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;padding:12px;background:#f4f0e7;color:#29383d;font:15px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(145px,1fr));gap:8px}label{display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:13px}select,input,button{min-height:44px;padding:7px;border:1px solid #c8c1b5;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;color:inherit;font:inherit}input[type=range]{padding:0;accent-color:#3d7d83}.wide{grid-column:span 2}.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.row input{flex:1}.buttons{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.paint{touch-action:none;cursor:crosshair}.views{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:12px}.panel{min-width:0}.panel b{font-size:13px}canvas{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.5;display:block;border:1px solid #cfc8bb;background:#fff}.note{min-height:1.5em;font-size:13px;color:#52666a}@media(max-width:650px){.views{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:450px){body{padding:8px}.controls{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.wide{grid-column:span 2}}</style></head><body>\n<div class=\"controls\"><label>元の絵<select id=\"source\"><option value=\"seaside\">海辺</option><option value=\"plant\">鉢植え</option><option value=\"desk\">机の上</option></select></label><label>マスクを塗る値<select id=\"maskVal\"><option value=\"0\">黒：止める</option><option value=\"50\" selected>灰：半分通す</option><option value=\"100\">白：通す</option></select></label>\n<label class=\"wide\">暗さを重視する割合 α<div class=\"row\"><span>輪郭</span><input id=\"blend\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"5\" value=\"65\"><output id=\"blendText\">65%</output><span>暗さ</span></div></label>\n<label>筆の半径<select id=\"radius\"><option>14</option><option selected>32</option><option>58</option></select></label><label>候補数<select id=\"count\"><option>600</option><option selected>1200</option><option>2400</option></select></label><label>勾配基準<select id=\"ref\"><option>90</option><option selected>180</option><option>360</option></select></label><label>線の長さ<select id=\"length\"><option>8</option><option selected>16</option><option>24</option></select></label><label>線の太さ<select id=\"width\"><option>1</option><option selected>3</option><option>5</option></select></label><label>色<select id=\"color\"><option value=\"sample\">元の色</option><option value=\"gray\">白黒</option><option value=\"warm\">朱色</option></select></label><label>シード<input id=\"seed\" type=\"number\" value=\"42\"></label>\n<div class=\"wide buttons\"><button id=\"all0\">全体を止める</button><button id=\"all50\">全体を半分</button><button id=\"all100\">全体を通す</button><button id=\"redraw\">描き直す</button><button id=\"newseed\">別のシード</button></div></div>\n<p>マスクを指やマウスで塗ります。黒は描画を止め、白は特徴から計算した確率をそのまま通し、灰色は確率を弱めます。</p>\n<div class=\"views\"><div class=\"panel\"><b>元の絵</b><canvas id=\"src\" aria-label=\"海辺や植物などの模式図\"></canvas></div><div class=\"panel\"><b>許可マスク（指・マウスで塗る）</b><canvas id=\"mask\" class=\"paint\" aria-label=\"描画する場所を許可するマスク\"></canvas></div><div class=\"panel\"><b>暗さと輪郭を合わせた確率</b><canvas id=\"map\" aria-label=\"特徴とマスクで計算した最終確率\"></canvas></div><div class=\"panel\"><b>抽選で残った筆跡</b><canvas id=\"out\" aria-label=\"マスク範囲に描かれた筆跡\"></canvas></div></div><p id=\"info\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n<script>\nconst W=480,H=320,src=document.querySelector(\"#src\"),sc=src.getContext(\"2d\"),mask=document.querySelector(\"#mask\"),mx=mask.getContext(\"2d\"),map=document.querySelector(\"#map\"),mc=map.getContext(\"2d\"),out=document.querySelector(\"#out\"),ctx=out.getContext(\"2d\");for(let c of [src,mask,map,out]){c.width=W;c.height=H}\nfunction gray(a,x,y){x=Math.max(0,Math.min(W-1,x));y=Math.max(0,Math.min(H-1,y));let i=(y*W+x)*4;return .299*a[i]+.587*a[i+1]+.114*a[i+2]}\nfunction make(k){sc.fillStyle=\"#eee9dd\";sc.fillRect(0,0,W,H);if(k===\"seaside\"){sc.fillStyle=\"#a9cbd0\";sc.fillRect(0,0,W,195);sc.fillStyle=\"#e7d4b0\";sc.fillRect(0,195,W,125);for(let y=205;y<290;y+=19){sc.strokeStyle=y%3?\"#658d93\":\"#f5eee0\";sc.lineWidth=3;sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(0,y);sc.bezierCurveTo(110,y-13,280,y+12,480,y-7);sc.stroke()}sc.fillStyle=\"#d5b77c\";sc.fillRect(110,122,65,73);sc.fillStyle=\"#6b7a67\";sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(90,122);sc.lineTo(142,75);sc.lineTo(197,122);sc.fill()}else if(k===\"plant\"){sc.fillStyle=\"#c8dedc\";sc.fillRect(0,0,165,H);sc.strokeStyle=\"#fff\";sc.lineWidth=6;sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(82,0);sc.lineTo(82,H);sc.moveTo(0,155);sc.lineTo(165,155);sc.stroke();sc.strokeStyle=\"#506e53\";sc.lineWidth=5;sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(290,280);sc.lineTo(280,75);sc.stroke();for(let i=0;i<8;i++){sc.fillStyle=i%2?\"#708f67\":\"#496b50\";sc.beginPath();sc.ellipse(210+(i%3)*52,80+Math.floor(i/3)*57,42,17,-.5,0,6.3);sc.fill()}sc.fillStyle=\"#ad7054\";sc.fillRect(238,240,92,64)}else{sc.fillStyle=\"#d5e5e2\";sc.fillRect(0,0,W,208);sc.fillStyle=\"#b99570\";sc.fillRect(0,208,W,112);sc.fillStyle=\"#92b9bd\";sc.fillRect(26,28,130,144);sc.fillStyle=\"#eee8dc\";sc.fillRect(175,178,140,32);sc.fillStyle=\"#765d49\";sc.fillRect(355,156,64,73);sc.fillStyle=\"#fbf7ea\";sc.beginPath();sc.ellipse(387,157,32,8,0,0,6.3);sc.fill()}}\nfunction feature(g,m,a,ref){return a*(1-g/255)+(1-a)*Math.min(m/ref,1)}\nfunction draw(){make(document.querySelector(\"#source\").value);let a=sc.getImageData(0,0,W,H).data,ma=mx.getImageData(0,0,W,H).data,blend=+document.querySelector(\"#blend\").value/100,ref=+document.querySelector(\"#ref\").value,im=mc.createImageData(W,H);for(let y=0;y<H;y++)for(let x=0;x<W;x++){let i=(y*W+x)*4,gx=gray(a,x+1,y)-gray(a,x-1,y),gy=gray(a,x,y+1)-gray(a,x,y-1),p=(ma[i]/255)*feature(gray(a,x,y),Math.hypot(gx,gy),blend,ref),v=Math.round(255*p);im.data[i]=247-v*.45;im.data[i+1]=243-v*.51;im.data[i+2]=232-v*.55;im.data[i+3]=255}mc.putImageData(im,0,0);ctx.fillStyle=\"#f4f0e6\";ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);let seed=Math.floor(+document.querySelector(\"#seed\").value||1);seed=(seed-1)%2147483646+1;function rand(){seed=seed*16807%2147483647;return(seed-1)/2147483646}let n=+document.querySelector(\"#count\").value,len=+document.querySelector(\"#length\").value,lw=+document.querySelector(\"#width\").value,mode=document.querySelector(\"#color\").value,kept=0;for(let j=0;j<n;j++){let x=rand()*W,y=rand()*H,ix=Math.floor(x),iy=Math.floor(y),i=(iy*W+ix)*4,R=a[i],G=a[i+1],B=a[i+2],g=.299*R+.587*G+.114*B,gx=gray(a,ix+1,iy)-gray(a,ix-1,iy),gy=gray(a,ix,iy+1)-gray(a,ix,iy-1),m=Math.hypot(gx,gy),alpha=ma[i]/255,p=alpha*feature(g,m,blend,ref),ang=m<4?0:Math.atan2(gy,gx)+Math.PI/2;if(rand()<p){kept++;ctx.strokeStyle=mode===\"warm\"?\"#bd5d45\":mode===\"gray\"?\"rgb(\"+g+\",\"+g+\",\"+g+\")\":\"rgb(\"+R+\",\"+G+\",\"+B+\")\";ctx.lineWidth=lw;ctx.lineCap=\"round\";ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x-Math.cos(ang)*len/2,y-Math.sin(ang)*len/2);ctx.lineTo(x+Math.cos(ang)*len/2,y+Math.sin(ang)*len/2);ctx.stroke()}}document.querySelector(\"#blendText\").textContent=Math.round(blend*100)+\"%\";document.querySelector(\"#info\").textContent=\"候補 \"+n+\" 個・採用 \"+kept+\" 個。マスク黒=0は抽選確率0、白=1は特徴の確率をそのまま使います。\"}\nlet painting=false;function dab(e){let r=mask.getBoundingClientRect(),x=(e.clientX-r.left)*W/r.width,y=(e.clientY-r.top)*H/r.height,v=+document.querySelector(\"#maskVal\").value,g=Math.round(v*2.55);mx.strokeStyle=\"rgb(\"+g+\",\"+g+\",\"+g+\")\";mx.lineWidth=+document.querySelector(\"#radius\").value;mx.lineCap=\"round\";mx.beginPath();mx.moveTo(x,y);mx.lineTo(x+.01,y+.01);mx.stroke();draw()}mask.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\",e=>{painting=true;mask.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);dab(e)});mask.addEventListener(\"pointermove\",e=>{if(painting)dab(e)});mask.addEventListener(\"pointerup\",()=>painting=false);mask.addEventListener(\"pointercancel\",()=>painting=false);\nfor(let id of [\"source\",\"maskVal\",\"blend\",\"radius\",\"count\",\"ref\",\"length\",\"width\",\"color\",\"seed\"]){let e=document.querySelector(\"#\"+id);e.addEventListener(\"input\",draw);e.addEventListener(\"change\",draw)}document.querySelector(\"#all0\").onclick=()=>{mx.fillStyle=\"#000\";mx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);draw()};document.querySelector(\"#all50\").onclick=()=>{mx.fillStyle=\"rgb(128,128,128)\";mx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);draw()};document.querySelector(\"#all100\").onclick=()=>{mx.fillStyle=\"#fff\";mx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);draw()};document.querySelector(\"#redraw\").onclick=draw;document.querySelector(\"#newseed\").onclick=()=>{let e=document.querySelector(\"#seed\");e.value=String((+e.value||1)+1);draw()};window.addEventListener(\"message\",e=>{if(e.data?.type===\"gal-experiment\")for(let c of e.data.controls||[]){let el=document.querySelector(c.selector);if(el){el.value=c.value;el.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"change\"))}}});mx.fillStyle=\"rgb(128,128,128)\";mx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);draw();\n</script></body></html>"
  },
